      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that seeing how much they have to do for me... it's embarrassing. like i'm just this person who exists to be managed and looked after. it feels less like a life and more like i'm just a problem they haven't solved yet. it'd be so much easier for everyone if they didn't have to worry about me anymore.",
